{"v3_40ba830f885d159cb8df6348":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは〜藤嶌果歩(20)です🐑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も雨ですね！\n天気に影響されてどんよりした気持ちになりがちですが最近の私はなにか上手くいかないことがあっても\nまあ、雨のせいか！と思って乗り越えています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地味に雨に助けられている日々なのです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日9月29日は\n18thシングル「イチャイチャ虫」の\nフラゲ日！！💖"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝SHIBUYA TSUTAYAさんにいっぱいサインを書きに行きましたー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今シングルも素敵なパネル展展示をして頂いておりますのでぜひ足を運んでくださると嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"展示は10月5日までなのでお早めに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月は色んなお仕事をさせて頂きました！\n9月のかほりんをチラ見せ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobeB6kAf.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobDpaiZH.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobszStZ6.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月に初お披露目した新衣装🩵\nミニシンデレラって呼んでる衣装だよ！\n最近ゆるゆるツイン団子ブームでよくやってる髪型🫶🏻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobvp7y6A.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mob9u0T7w.jpg",